OL,3,GNEWSAThreat was to US base, not town,
OL,4,Asays MP
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP says the government has confirmed
OL,7,Fthere was a threat to RAF Mildenhall in
OL,8,FSuffolk but not to the town itself.
OL,10,FMore than 12 US Air Force aircraft left
OL,11,FRAF Mildenhall weeks after the US
OL,12,Fwithdrew its bombers from RAF Fairford
OL,13,Fover a suspected Iran-linked security
OL,14,Fincident.
OL,16,FNick Timothy, the West Suffolk
OL,17,FConservative MP, said: "I spoke to a
OL,18,Fdefence minister again last night and
OL,19,Fshe confirmed to me that the threat was
OL,20,Fto the base and not to the town's
OL,21,Fcivilians or civilian infrastructure.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
